            "review_title": "Review at Pure Bowls - Acai Bowls",
            "review_text": "Ellie F\nTasmania, Australia18 contributions\n0\nGood Clean Energy\nOct 2023 • Couples\nThis is our second time here and the Açaí bowls are terrific. We had 2 medium size energy bowls which come with açaí, banana and guarana. Then you get to chose a further 2 fruits from a long list. It is topped off with chia seeds, shaved coconut, granola and slivered almonds. The bowls are a good size. If you are a big eater go the large. \nThe price is good. 2 bowls and an egg coffee cost $385 000 VND, about $20 AUD for us. Much better price than what we pay at home. \nThe shop is modern and clean and the air conditioning is a great escape from the heat and humidity outside. This is a definite if you enjoy your health foods.\nRead more\nWritten October 26, 2023",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-13",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
